<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SEPT CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT UP 10.3 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH SEPT CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT UP 10.3 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction output in the Czech</p>
<p>Republic rose 10.3 percent in September in real terms compared</p>
<p>with the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau said</p>
<p>on Monday.</p>
<p>    CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT  SEPT/96   AUG/96  SEPT/95 JAN-SEPT/96</p>
<p>    real pct chg yr/yr  +10.3    + 7.2    -0.1	  +6.4</p>
<p>avg nominal monthly</p>
<p>    wages chg yr/yr     +15.6    +12.1    +13.0	 +15.4</p>
<p>Note: Output figures are based on all sizes of companies.</p>
<p>Wage figures are calculated only on the basis of companies with</p>
<p>25 or more employees.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
